{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cfddca66-2ce3-8879-8e35-9cd24cb01f39",
  "created_at": "2026-02-02T11:47:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:45:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:45:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Is it all right if I ask about a parking ticket? I got one and I think it's wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:45:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Do you have the ticket number in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I have it. It says snow parking ban violation. But here's the thing, the street was never plowed. Not once. And there wasn't a single sign posted on Bacheller Street either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. May I have the address where the vehicle was parked, and the ticket number, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 17 Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward. Ticket number is, um, 4 4 0 7 1 9 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me pull that up. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I have it here. It was issued during the declared parking ban, and there is a photograph attached to the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so is it all right if I ask for that photo? Can you email it to me? I'd like to actually see what they're going by, because I'm telling you, that street was snow-covered the whole time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can send the photograph to you. What email address would you like me to use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it's nelson dot resendes at, hold on, I should have it ready. Is it okay if I give it to you slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Go ahead whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. N-E-L-S-O-N, dot, R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S, at mailbox dot example."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:46:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reading that back: nelson dot resendes, at mailbox dot example. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Sorry, you remind me of this nurse I knew once. Very kind, very patient with everybody. Same way of talking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:47:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's kind of you to say. I'll send the photograph this afternoon. If you wish to contest the ticket, the instructions are on the back of the notice, and a hearing request must be made by the deadline printed there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll look at the photo first and then do that. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T11:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Resendes. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
